    activity: { title: "Three-Read Challenge", instructions: "Choose a short passage from a textbook or article. Read it three times. First read: write a 2-sentence summary. Second read: identify the text structure and list three techniques the author uses. Third read: choose two specific word choices and explain why the author chose them. Annotate during each read using different colors. Compare your annotations — notice how much more you see with each reading." },
